'''A Not So Special Lizard''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Master|master combat achievement]] which requires the player to kill the [[Great Olm]] in a solo [[Chambers of Xeric|raid]] without letting him use any of the following special attacks in his second-to-last phase: [[Great_Olm#Special_Attacks|Crystal Burst]], [[Great_Olm#Special_Attacks|Lightning Walls]], [[Great_Olm#Special_Attacks|Teleportation Portals]] or [[Great_Olm#Special_Attacks|left-hand autohealing]].

